<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $63-3/8 (FIM 310.04).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $63-3/8 (FIM 310.04).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR closed up $0-3/4 at $63-3/8 in New York on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Nokia's Wall Street closing equals about 310.04 markka.</p>
<p>In Helsinki on Tuesday, Nokia A closed up 3.00 at 313.00.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) closed up $1-1/8 at $36 on Wall Street. The price equals about 88.06 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet closed up 3.10 markka at 88.00.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR fell $0-1/4 to $19-1/4 in New York on Tuesday. The price equals to about 94.17 markka. In Helsinki, Rauma closed up 2.50 markka at 97.50.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245</p>
